    "conclusion": "Every attribute matches a tenant on a DIFFERENT property, because the same lease PDF (lease-whole-health-market.pdf) was uploaded to both. A matcher keyed on name+sqft+cap+dates would confidently attach an LV reconciliation to a Cascade Commons tenant. The strongest available signal produces a cross-property false positive."
